-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Thai Province Data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source:  https://github.com/kongvut/thai-province-data
Commit:  7d689e478a577a1c9348f2b998c39dd4c2bf153d (2026-09-29)
Files:   api/latest/province.json, api/latest/district.json,
         api/latest/sub_district.json, data/raw/geographies.json
Used in: src/data/data.ts (names, codes, postcodes, regions)

Changes made by scripts/build-data.ts:
- Removed districts 7074 and 9077, which have no sub-districts.
- Replaced the running province numbers with two-digit DOPA province codes.
- Removed a stray "*" from two English sub-district names (470704, 841505).
- Dropped the prefix, timestamp and coordinate fields, and reshaped the rows
  into compact arrays sorted by Thai name.

