2. Thailand - Subnational Administrative Boundaries (COD-AB)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source:  https://data.humdata.org/dataset/cod-ab-tha
Origin:  Royal Thai Survey Department, published by OCHA Field Information
         Services Section (FISS) on the Humanitarian Data Exchange
File:    tha_admin_boundaries.xlsx, sheet tha_admin3
         (columns adm3_pcode, center_lat, center_lon)
Used in: data/centroids.csv and the lat/lng fields in src/data/data.ts

Changes: removed the "TH" prefix from the codes, rounded the coordinates to
5 decimal places, kept only the three columns above.

